mo><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(6, -4)</annotation></semantics></math>).","accept":["-2 m/s^2"]},{"point":"Speeding up, because <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(5) = -2 &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a(5) = -2 &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math> have the same sign.","accept":["speeding up: velocity and acceleration are both negative at t = 5"]}],"sample":"<math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">′</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a(5) = v'(5) = \\frac{-4 - 4}{6 - 2} = -2</annotation></semantics></math> m/s². Since <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(5) = -2 &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a(5) &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math>, velocity and acceleration have the same sign, so the particle is speeding up."},{"label":"b","prompt":"At what times <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math> in <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 &lt; t &lt; 12</annotation></semantics></math> does the particle change direction? <b>Justify</b> your answer.","points":2,"rubric":[{"point":"<math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 4</annotation></semantics></math> and <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 10</annotation></semantics></math>.","accept":["t = 4 and t = 10"]},{"point":"Justification: <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math> changes sign at each time (positive to negative at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 4</annotation></semantics></math>, negative to positive at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 10</annotation></semantics></math>).","accept":["v changes sign at t = 4 and at t = 10"]}],"sample":"<math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(t)</annotation></semantics></math> changes from positive to negative at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 4</annotation></semantics></math> and from negative to positive at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 10</annotation></semantics></math>, so the particle changes direction at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 4</annotation></semantics></math> and <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 10</annotation></semantics></math>."},{"label":"c","prompt":"The particle is at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = 5</annotation></semantics></math> at time <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 0</annotation></semantics></math>. <b>Find</b> its position at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 12</annotation></semantics></math>.","points":2,"rubric":[{"point":"Setup: <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo largeop=\"true\" movablelimits=\"false\">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>12</mn></msubsup><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(12) = 5 + \\int_0^{12} v(t)\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math>.","accept":["x(0) plus the integral of v from 0 to 12"]},{"point":"Areas: <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8 + 4 - 4 - 8 - 4 + 2 = -2</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(12) = 3</annotation></semantics></math> meters.","accept":["x(12) = 3"]}],"sample":"<math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo largeop=\"true\" movablelimits=\"false\">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>12</mn></msubsup><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{12} v(t)\\,dt = 8 + 4 - 4 - 8 - 4 + 2 = -2</annotation></semantics></math> (a rectangle, two triangles on <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[2, 6]</annotation></semantics></math>, a rectangle, a triangle below the axis, a triangle above). So <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo form=\"prefix\" lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\">−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(12) = 5 + (-2) = 3</annotation></semantics></math> meters."},{"label":"d","prompt":"<b>Find</b> the total distance the particle travels over <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\le t \\le 12</annotation></semantics></math>. At what time is the particle farthest to the left? <b>Justify</b> your answer.","points":3,"rubric":[{"point":"Total distance <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo largeop=\"true\" movablelimits=\"false\">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>12</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\int_0^{12} |v(t)|\\,dt = 8 + 4 + 4 + 8 + 4 + 2 = 30</annotation></semantics></math> meters.","accept":["30 meters"]},{"point":"Candidates: <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(0) = 5</annotation></semantics></math>, <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(4) = 17</annotation></semantics></math>, <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(10) = 1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(12) = 3</annotation></semantics></math>.","accept":["positions at the endpoints and at the direction changes"]},{"point":"Farthest left at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 10</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(10) = 1</annotation></semantics></math> is the least of the candidates.","accept":["t = 10 with x = 1 and a candidates comparison"]}],"sample":"Total distance <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo largeop=\"true\" movablelimits=\"false\">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>12</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\int_0^{12} |v(t)|\\,dt = 8 + 4 + 4 + 8 + 4 + 2 = 30</annotation></semantics></math> meters. The particle can be farthest left only at an endpoint or where <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math> changes sign: <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(0) = 5</annotation></semantics></math>, <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(4) = 5 + 12 = 17</annotation></semantics></math>, <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(10) = 17 - 16 = 1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(12) = 1 + 2 = 3</annotation></semantics></math>. The least is <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(10) = 1</annotation></semantics></math>, so it is farthest left at <math class=\"calc-m\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = 10</annotation></semantics></math>."}]}